The overlay does not work when the output is rotated (under randr12)

To reproduce:
1) Start nouveau, using randr12
2) xrandr -o 2
3) mplayer foo.avi
4) cry

Since rotation is commonly used for projectors (where there's a reasonable
chance of Xv being used), this is not a made up problem :)

Someone fixing the coordinate-fu would be awesome, but falling back to the
blitter is probably far far easier.


